<title>NEW ZEALAND: Hallenstein first half net falls 26 pct.</title>
<headline>Hallenstein first half net falls 26 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr to Feb 1.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				  4.81 vs 6.51</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    8.3 vs 11.2</p>
<p>    Div (cents)			    7.0 vs 9.0</p>
<p>    Turnover				78.0 vs 78.1</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			  7.1 vs 9.6</p>
<p>    Tax					2.3 vs 3.1</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)    58.0 vs 58.0</p>
<p>Dividend carries full imputation credits.</p>
<p>Pay date April 30</p>
<p>Reg date April 18</p>
<p>Note - Hallenstein Glasson Holdings Ltd is a clothes retailer.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
